Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,truly grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you wanna fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nplans, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon\Nout on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI want to take you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that\NI want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But after the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.52,0:02:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you to the far\Nends of the new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The G-G-Cannonball!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No more biscuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet General Smoothie has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet General Katakuri should be\Narriving any moment now as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.53,0:03:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be a real treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.98,0:03:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ages since\Neveryone got together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what about Cracker?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't he be back home by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, I'm sure, and with\NStraw Hat's head is a gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:03:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.51,0:04:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.82,0:04:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in terrible shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cracker's one of our sweet three generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill whoever did this to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems he came flying from pretty far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have been the seducing woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He was supposed to take care\Nof Straw Hat Luffy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is still at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Put out an emergency alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to take shelter now! What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet General Cracker got\Nbeat by Straw Hat! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.34,0:05:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That was insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate a lifetime's worth of biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, looks like you're shrinking already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, that's because fourth\Ngear uses a lot of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you hiding in the bushes? Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran away so Cracker wouldn't murder me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you guys were\Ngoing to lose for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're blunt, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, he's one of\Nthe sweet three generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That was scary, but... We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.03,0:06:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Would I kill you guys to cheer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.40,0:06:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be one of Big Mom's\Ntop fighters, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.81,0:06:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've engaged in treachery most foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We helped the enemy, and now\NGeneral Cracker has lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in Totoland knows that Mama's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,vivacard holds tremendous\Npower over us homies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she doesn't share\Npieces of it to anyone anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,not even to the little\NSprouts in her own family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So why do you have one? Oh, neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing is even more\Nvaluable than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you're in much\Nworse trouble than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A while back, Sweet General\NSnack got taken down, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Cracker's fleet painted the\Nsea black with their numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and Linlin's fury summoned the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy ships, powerful as they were,\Ngot torn to shreds in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Linlin can command the\Nweather, quite literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She controls weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In her left hand, Zeus, a thunder cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In her right hand,\NPrometheus, a living sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Once her rage is awakened, there's\Nnothing in this world that can stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you better get the heck out of here before\Nshe finds out what you did to her boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She can get as mad as\Nshe wants. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should be angry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't get over what Saji did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he leave without telling us why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All we got was a dumb note.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my problem to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So give everybody my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we only made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Pudding's map,\Nand we already lost Peckums.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have Sanji by now,\Nbut nobody showed at the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know if it was a trap or\Nif something bad happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we got lost in the\Nforest, wasted time, fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Sanji gets married, he'll\Nbe part of Big Mom's crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and it'll be too late to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we gotta get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but when is the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cracker said the Vinsmokes were headed\Nto some castle for the ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and that should be today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.66,0:09:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We might have enough time to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Time isn't the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't run away, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tree! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You know where the castle\Nis, don't you? I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, I need you to carry me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nein, I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't quit. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking Soji back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.98,0:10:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you doing? Hanging in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be able to meet up with you\Nand Brooke if everything works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't sound like things\Nare working out at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't help us from outside the\Nmirror, so it's better not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep going for...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, Nabi, everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doing right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, everything's fine, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we'll keep heading to\Nthe castle and hope we run into Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.82,0:10:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you rescue him, use that\Npiece of the mirror to contact us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.98,0:10:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper? Carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a normal mirror now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hope they're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's shrinking down already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.42,0:11:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's freaking me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's almost back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The human body doesn't work like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme meat! Meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Fraulein!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got good luck. Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's German double six.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So is Sanji with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, something\Nis charging towards us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:12:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot, he made it all\Nthe way to whole cake island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's with that tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's running.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally made it—I was\Nafraid we'd be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks like we're right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.78,0:12:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad—how amusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,how amusing That's Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He came here to pick you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna tip over\Nthe calicoat, you maniac!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'd be back,\Nbut I didn't want to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was gonna come alone, but\Nit turned into a whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You mentioned your hands\Nare important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try to flee, your\Nhands will be blown off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens\Nif you know Sholeiloh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro took a team and\Nheaded to the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hesitate to relieve\Nthis man of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's me, Brook, Nami, and\NChopper who came to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be a sacrifice for\Nthe family, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't changed my opinion of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.72,0:13:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But as a man, if you ever\Nstray from the honorable path,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll slit my own throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji! I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And I do not think of you as a worthy son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because as a parent, I've\Ngot to take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Loving you as a son is my greatest shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain more back on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave my sight, bunch\Nof low-class pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.40,0:14:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake, I have\Nalways been a Vinsmoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Which makes me a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the Germa kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept all this a secret from you because,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,knowing this would make\Nthings harder for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that it's out, you can see there's\Na clear difference in our standings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If I stay here, I'll\Nhave all the servants,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,soldiers, and riches\NI could ever dream of!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can go back to that crappy ship with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you and your friends\Non some dumb adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I can stay right here\Nand marry the beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,daughter of a wealthy\Nand powerful emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which of those do you\Nthink would make me happier?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll spell it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wrote that note\Nto get you off my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's noble of you to come all the way\Nhere to get me, but you wasted your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already forgotten your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You big liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I'm gonna buy\Nthat don't worry Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you drive them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.22,0:15:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send him packing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you'll send me packing\NI want you to leave what else can I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know why you thought\Nthis was a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have been easy to get here,\Nso I know you must want me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But having said that, if you\Nreally value my happiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.58,0:15:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you have all this backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.47,0:15:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you guys are poor and weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,especially compared to the Big Mom Pirates,\Nwho are generous enough to take me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So why would I ever choose you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the big leagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You being king of the\Npirates is a pipe dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only human nature\Nto pick the winning side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.68,0:16:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this is funny, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you're saying makes any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So we were never really friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You were fooling me all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.82,0:16:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Never thought much of you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.54,0:16:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just summon a flame? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we got Frontier seats to this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.98,0:16:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it hard to accept I imagine\Nyou two didn't see this coming
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll prove it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.12,0:16:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Diablo Jamba
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.20,0:17:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo shot
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.38,0:17:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Sanji serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.74,0:17:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I said get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't use your Haki, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I need Haki for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.26,0:18:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't fight, then go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not happening, you're stuck with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Selfish as usual, all right\Nthen have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So listen, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cook, why don't you leave\Nthis boat and join my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use a cook like\Nyou on my pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to fight, we want to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:18:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock fought all night against one of Big\NMom's strongest generals to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in no shape to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're having a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's what you think this is, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:19:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.49,0:20:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lupi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.28,0:22:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Sanji, you don't\Nhave to go through with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go, just don't hurt Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good cook and I need one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.84,0:22:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously we should be pirates together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunkasee!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What amazing strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.82,0:23:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd expect nothing less\Nif I've been smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.46,0:23:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you're\Nall right? Luffy! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you gotta get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.78,0:23:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.32,0:23:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.26,0:23:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.30,0:23:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.66,0:23:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we ever came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.18,0:23:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, damn, that is so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.18,0:23:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I like him, Feisty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.28,0:24:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Their ties were meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.92,0:24:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad he severed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.68,0:24:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.59,0:24:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.10,0:24:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.88,0:24:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.70,0:24:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.04,0:24:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.80,0:24:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All your excuses sounded so fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why you said that\Ncrap, but I know you didn't mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.10,0:24:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's going to make me leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.02,0:24:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Like we aren't friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.22,0:24:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple of dumb lies won't\Nmake me give up on my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.82,0:24:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.84,0:24:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.52,0:24:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.34,0:25:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you kick me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you're the one who's getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.04,0:25:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, for some reason, Sanji's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.96,0:25:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.42,0:25:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.62,0:25:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.92,0:25:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.50,0:25:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, have you ever\Nheard of the All-Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.08,0:25:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That sea is a genuine miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.50,0:25:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It has it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.40,0:25:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our journey isn't over!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.16,0:25:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying right here and\NI'm not moving an inch!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.76,0:26:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna keep waiting\Nfor you to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.44,0:26:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you leave me here,\NI'll just starve to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.08,0:26:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.86,0:26:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else can take your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji was making some\Nof that rat food again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.98,0:26:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not eating another bite of\Nanything unless you cook it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.04,0:26:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I get hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.18,0:26:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,even if spears or swords or stones break\Ndown on me, I'll keep waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.16,0:26:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you better come back you hear me no matter
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.80,0:26:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,what i need you on my\Ncrew sanji without you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.24,0:27:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,without you i'll never\Nbe king of the pirates
